msgctxt "108"
msgid ""
"I don't see any celebrities. Hell, there aren't even any other people in "
"here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid ""
"Hey, you can't expect it to be packed all the time. Come on,\r\n"
"let's order."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "It's my treat, so get whatever you want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "Whoa, really!? Thanks a ton, Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"Alright, let's go with two beers, some kalbi, some sirloin,\r\n"
"an order of salted tongue, a plate of tripe... and oh, some\r\n"
"Iberico pork while you're at it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "Uh, Rikiya..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"Oh yeah, and make all that a double portion for me and my\r\n"
"aniki here! Then I'll have a kimchi combo and a kalbi soup\r\n"
"on top of that, and some nice chilled noodles for dessert!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "You want some soup, too, Aniki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "I don't think my stomach can fit all that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"By the way, Aniki. I was strollin' around town for a while\r\n"
"before we met up. Sure are a lot of interesting folks here in\r\n"
"Kamurocho, huh? Weirdos, businessmen, schoolgirls..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"Yeah. You could just spend an entire year peoplewatching\r\n"
"and never run out of new subjects. Makes you wonder how\r\n"
"their lives all led up to this point, converging in this city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "Totally. Wonder if I can find what I'm after here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "What are you talking about?"
msgstr "Di cosa stai parlando?"

msgctxt "324"
msgid ""
"C'mon, Aniki. We talked about this right after you beat the\r\n"
"human stuffing outta me. I'm looking for a guy to finish my\r\n"
"viper tattoo, remember?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid ""
"Right, sorry. Your other tattoo artist died before he could\r\n"
"finish it, didn't he?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"Mhm. I don't wanna trust my viper to anyone who doesn't get\r\n"
"what the spirit of Okinawa's all about..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid ""
"But I'm kinda startin' to think someone here might have what\r\n"
"it takes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"Guy who's lived in Kamurocho, seen all sortsa people come n'\r\n"
"go, even if they're not from Okinawa... I bet he could get\r\n"
"what I'm goin' for. Whaddya think, Aniki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "Well... I might just know someone who can help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "For real? Can we go see him!? If we got the time, I mean."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid ""
"Sure, why not? But let's do some sightseeing first. All\r\n"
"we've done so far is sit in this restaurant..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "Totally! Let's get a move on!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "Man, Aniki! That was like a party in my mouth!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "...I guess you could put it that way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "Your total comes out to 65,000 yen, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid "You, um... have any cash on you, Rikiya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid "Don't tell me you don't have enough, Aniki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid ""
"You spent <Color:8>all of your money<Color:Default>\r\n"
"while Rikiya covered the rest..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "Oh well, accidents happen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "You paid <Color:8>65,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai pagato <Color:8>50.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "600"
msgid "Thanks a lot, Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr "E di che."

msgctxt "624"
msgid "Oh, and we're splitting the bill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid "Huh? Sure... Of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "Something wrong with that?"
msgstr "Che c'è di male?"

msgctxt "660"
msgid "Oh, no. Not at all. Nothing. Nope! Ignore me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid "...Uh-huh. Let's just order."
msgstr ""

